The '''Mithril Gourmand''' is an active event that can happen in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}}. 

== Mechanics ==
During the event, certain area in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} will be selected, and in there mining {{Item|Mithril|text=Mithril Ore}} will have a {{Green|30%}} chance to drop a {{Item|Tasty Mithril}}. {{Item|Tasty Mithril|amount=100-200}} has to be given to {{NPCSprite|Don Expresso}} to complete the event. 

'''Mithril Gourmand''' event lasts for {{Green|10}} minutes. If requirement is fulfilled, timer will be shortened to {{Green|1}} minute.

=== Rewards ===
If the player gives {{NPCSprite|Don Expresso}} at least {{Item|Tasty Mithril|amount=10}}, they will gain extra rewards. Similarly to the [[Raffle]] event, players need to bring the items to a specific location, this location can be reached with the command {{Code|/tptodonexpresso}}. Also similarly to [[Raffle]], collected Tasty Mithril is only useful in the event during which it has been obtained.

