== Tips ==
{{Main|Mithril Powder#Increasing Mithril Powder Gain}}
*Players can use the {{Reforge|Royal}} reforge to increase their gain of {{Mithril Powder}} from this and other [[Mining Events]].
*It is recommended to wait until the last minute to cash in {{Item Display|Tasty Mithril!Tasty Mithril clumps}} as the individual {{Mithril Powder}} reward scale with the amount of {{Item|Tasty Mithril}} donated. This allows for all participants to fully benefit from the event.

